        <head>DRAW FOR THE FIFTH ROUND.</head>
        <p>DRAW FOR THE FIFTH ROUND.</p>
        <p>A Forster, Cemetery v T Ellison, Whitecross E Taylor, Senior Conservative v J W Jolley, Bull's Head</p>
        <p>N Fielding, Cemetery v 3 Holland, Seri Conservative H Williams, [glands' v G Bill, jun, Cemetery CLUB CHAMPIONSHIP. After the Individual Merit Competition to-day the cup final between liylands' it-•creation and the Cemetery Hotel Club will take place on the green of the Ryland., Recreation at four o'clock. Referee, Mr 'l' Horrabin.</p>
        <p>CONSOLATION COMPETITION. The final of the consolation of the Cup Competition between the Liberal Club and Penketh Park will take place on the former green at three o'clock. Referee, Mr S Leigh.</p>
