        <p>LAWN TENNIS. CAUSEWAY v. CROSFIELD'S RECREATION. Flayed at Wilderspool on Saturday. The Causeway won 10 events to 1 (1 unfinished), 21 sets to 2, and 135 games to 61. W Woods and Mrs H Hope beat Mr Evans and Miss Antrobus, 6-2, 6-5 ; S Woods and Miss Wilson beat Mr Percival and Miss Antrobus 6-4, 6-0; 142. R Gandy and Miss Isaac beat Mr Sandy and Miss Bennett 6-1, 6-4 ; H Hope and Miss E Jackson beat Mr Snelling, and Mrs Gandy 6-3, 6-4 ; H Bibby and Mrs Woods beat Mr Winter and Miss Antrobus, jun., 6-0, 6-1 ; H Massink and Miss D Isaac beat Mr McCav‘ley and Miss Stirrup 6-1, 6.4. Mrs H Hope and Miss Wilson beat Miss Ant robus and Mrs Gandy 6-2, 6-1 ; Miss Isaac and Miss E Jackson beat Miss Bennett and Miss Antrobus, junr., 6-0, 6.1 ; Mrs Woods and Miss D Issao v Miss Stirrup and Miss Bennett, abandoned owing to rain. W and S Woods best Messrs Evans and Sandy 6-3, 6-3 ; E R Gandy and H Hope lost to Messrs Percival and Snelling, 6-3, 5-6, 4-6 ; El Bibby and H Massink neat Messrs Winter and McCauley 6-3, 6-4.</p>
